&lt;p style="margin-left: 66px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18px"&gt;3　Sony Corporation of America、Sony Interactive Entertainment LLC、Sony Interactive Entertainment Europe Ltd.、Sony Europe B.V.及びSony Pictures Entertainment Inc.の各数値は連結決算数値です。&lt;/p&gt;
