&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="style_pb_after" style="line-height: 1; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -12px"&gt;(2) 確定拠出制度&lt;/p&gt;
